      "claim": "Chameleon skin colour is controlled by chromatophores whose activity is regulated by neural and hormonal signals linked to body temperature.",
      "evidence": "Herpetology literature describes the role of melanophores, iridophores and xanthophores in thermoregulatory colour change (e.g., Ligon & McGraw 2015).",
